# Flow 8, typing with the on-screen keyboard (no physical keyboard: input.state says none): a touch-only pass. New note by
# taps, the name on the keyboard's keys, its Enter creates; the editor with the keyboard up (the bar hidden), text typed
# (as the keyboard injects it); the keyboard's Esc puts it away (the bar comes back); Preview, Edit by taps; the header's
# Esc saves and goes back with the keyboard up; Open or create: only the field above the keyboard, its Enter shows the
# matches; a keyboard connecting takes it away.
keyboard off
wait 900
tap "New note"
tap "New note"
wait 600
expect state page new
expect osk on
shot 01-new-osk
check new-osk
tapkey "d"
tapkey "e"
tapkey "c"
tapkey "k"
wait 100
shot 02-name-osk
tapkey "<enter>"
wait 600
expect state page editor
expect file "deck.md" exists
expect osk on
expect state kbd 0
expect has "Hold 3 s: options"
shot 03-editor-osk
check editor-osk
tapkey "h"
tapkey "i"
tapkey "<space>"
type typed on the screen.
wait 1800
expect file "deck.md" contains "hi typed on the screen."
shot 04-typed
tapkey "Esc"
wait 500
expect osk off
expect state page editor
shot 05-keyboard-away
check editor-keyboard-away
# the options by a 3 s hold on the text (the cue, then the box): Preview
holdat 0.5 0.5 1500 05b-hold-cue
wait 300
expect state popup none
holdat 0.5 0.5 3300
wait 400
expect state popup menu
expect text "Preview"
shot 05c-editor-options
tap "Preview"
wait 600
expect state page preview
expect osk off
expect has "Hold 3 s: options"
shot 06-preview
holdat 0.5 0.6 3300
wait 400
expect state popup menu
expect text "Edit"
shot 06b-preview-options
tap "Edit"
wait 600
expect state page editor
expect osk on
type More
key enter
tap "Esc"
wait 600
expect state page home
expect osk off
expect file "deck.md" contains "More\nhi typed on the screen."
drag 0.5 0.35 0.5 0.9
# Open or create: the field alone above the keyboard; its Enter puts the keyboard away and shows the matches
tap "Open or create…"
tap "Open or create…"
wait 600
expect state page open
expect osk on
shot 07-open-osk
check open-osk
tapkey "d"
tapkey "e"
tapkey "<enter>"
wait 500
expect osk off
expect state page open
expect text "deck"
shot 08-open-matches
tap "deck"
tap "deck"
wait 600
expect state page preview
# a keyboard connects: no on-screen keyboard in the editor any more
keyboard on
key ctrl-e
wait 600
expect state page editor
expect osk off
expect state kbd 1
expect has "Ctrl+O: options"
key esc
wait 400
